# SP6 step 5: the references the mock provider cannot evaluate. It returns a
# value for every attribute, so these three are checked as text.
# Format: file | regular expression the file must contain | message if it doesn't
terraform/ingest.tf | assume_role_policy *= *data.aws_iam_policy_document\.lambda_assume\.json | the role must use the trust-policy document's json
terraform/ingest.tf | policy *= *data.aws_iam_policy_document\.ingest_permissions\.json | the inline policy must use the permissions document's json, not the trust policy's
terraform/ingest.tf | source_code_hash *= *data.archive_file\.ingest\.output_base64sha256 | the function must set source_code_hash from the archive, so a rebuilt zip deploys
